    "title": "Trump halted deportation of S.Korean workers to encourage them to train Americans, FT reports - NewsBreak",
    "text": "By Reuters ,\n30 minutes ago\n(Reuters) -U.S. President Donald Trump halted the deportation of hundreds of South Korean Hyundai-LG battery plant workers arrested during an immigration enforcement raid and proposed they stay to train Americans, the Financial Times reported on Wednesday citing South Korean officials.\nReuters could not immediately confirm the report.\n(Reporting by Mrinmay Dey in Bengaluru; Editing by Kim Coghill)",
